OL,3,GNEWSACity's Local Plan set to be
OL,4,Areviewed again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan for 20,000 new homes in
OL,7,FPeterborough has been sent back to the
OL,8,Fcouncil's cabinet for further
OL,9,Fconsideration.
OL,11,FThe Local Plan is a key document that
OL,12,Fguides where new housing and employment
OL,13,Finfrastructure should be built, and
OL,14,Fidentifies areas that should be
OL,15,Fprotected. It was approved by cabinet
OL,16,Fin August, but was called in by the
OL,17,FConservative group.
OL,19,FAt Peterborough City Council's scrutiny
OL,20,Fmeeting, councillors agreed to refer
OL,21,Fthe decision back to a cabinet meeting
OL,22,Fdue to take place on 1 October.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
