OL,3,GNEWSACity's Local Plan set to be
OL,4,Areviewed again
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative group leader Wayne
OL,7,FFitzgerald said there were "serious
OL,8,Fflaws" in the approval process. "We
OL,9,Fwant to see a fair, open and
OL,10,Ftransparent process that involves all
OL,11,Felected members," he said.
